<title>SOUTH AFRICA: IB JOFFE SAYS TALKS TERMINATED.</title>
<headline>IB JOFFE SAYS TALKS TERMINATED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>IB Joffe on Wednesday advised shareholders that negotiations referred to in an announcement made on May 14 have been terminated.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
